OL,3,GNEWSAWhy Sussex is the heartland of
OL,4,ABonfire Night
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith autumn underway, Sussex towns are
OL,7,Fpreparing for another season of
OL,8,Ftraditional bonfire celebrations.
OL,10,FThe events run from early September to
OL,11,Fmid-November and attract tens of
OL,12,Fthousands of visitors with their
OL,13,Ftorchlit processions, elaborate
OL,14,Fcostumes and spectacular firework
OL,15,Fdisplays.
OL,17,FBonfire Night- officially on 5 November
OL,18,F- marks the failed Gunpowder Plot of
OL,19,F1605 when Guy Fawkes attempted to blow
OL,20,Fup the Houses of Parliament.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
